  <article>
    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2025/08/16/viltrox-27mm-f1.2.html">viltrox 27mm f1.2</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2025-08-16">16 August 2025</time></p>
    <p>Just started shooting on a Viltrox 27mm f1.2.</p>

<p>Here are pros and cons.</p>

<p>Pros:</p>
<ul>
  <li>sharp all around from 1.2 all the way to f11 before defraction takes over</li>
  <li>no barrel or pin cushion distortion</li>
  <li>no chromatic abberation</li>
</ul>

<p>Cons:</p>
<ul>
  <li>heavy lens especially if fitted on a smaller camera</li>
  <li>vignetting at f1.2. it goes away at around f4.</li>
  <li>little bit of flare when shot directly at a light</li>
</ul>

<p>Otherwise, fantastic lens with super sharp results.</p>

  </article>

