  <article>
    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2025/05/13/coffee-grind-settings.html">coffee grind settings</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2025-05-13">13 May 2025</time></p>
    <ul>
  <li>Espresso settings for the different brands of coffee.</li>
  <li>Double shots are 17 grams and single shots are 9.</li>
  <li>Grind settings are for Breville Smart Grinder.</li>
</ul>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="text-align: left">Coffee</th>
      <th style="text-align: left">Grind #</th>
