    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2024/02/06/supportconfig-options.html">supportconfig options</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2024-02-06">06 February 2024</time></p>
    <p>I ran supportconfig on a system the other day and it took all night. I gave up and killed it.</p>

<p>So, here are a few options that you can try to speed things up.</p>

