  <article>
    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2023/06/06/change-hostname-amazon-linux.html">change hostname amazon linux</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2023-06-06">06 June 2023</time></p>
    <p>Here’s how to make a hostname stick on Amazon Linux.</p>

<p>Set preserve_hostname to true in /etc/cloud/cloud.cfg.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>preserve_hostname: true
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Set the hostname in /etc/sysconfig/network.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>HOSTNAME=server.domain.com
NETWORKING=yes
NOZEROCONF=yes
</code></pre></div></div>

