  <article>
    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2022/11/30/open-browser-in-bash.html">open browser in bash</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2022-11-30">30 November 2022</time></p>
    <p>Here’s a nice little command to open a browser from Bash.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>#!/bin/bash
open https://domain.com/path/to/web/page/index.html
</code></pre></div></div>

