    <p>How to resize JPEG using FFMPEG.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>ffmpeg -i TREE.JPG -y -vf scale=iw*.2:ih*.2 tree.jpg
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Another option is to set resolution.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>ffmpeg -i TREE.JPG -y -vf scale=-1:720 tree.jpg
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>How to resize video using FFMPEG.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>ffmpeg -i TREE.MP4 -s 640x360 -pix_fmt yuv420p -crf 18 tree.mp4
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>How to create a thumbnail from a video.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>ffmpeg -ss 00:00:00 -i tree.mp4 -vframes 1 tree.jpg
</code></pre></div></div>

  </article>

