  <article>
    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2022/06/24/calculate-date-to-epoch-time.html">calculate date to epoch time</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2022-06-24">24 June 2022</time></p>
    <p>Here’s a script to convert date to epoch time on Mac OS.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>#!/bin/bash
if [[ -z $1 ]]; then
  echo "Format: date2epoch.sh 2022/01/01-04:58:06"
else
  echo "$1"; date -j -f date -j -f "%Y/%m/%d-%T" "$1" +"%s"
fi
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Result</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>$ ./date2epoch.sh 2022/08/31-22:00:00
2022/08/31-22:00:00
1661997600
</code></pre></div></div>

  </article>

