<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>python --version
python3 --version
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Start web server using port 8080 in the current directory.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>python -m http.server 8080
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>If you want an alternate directory, use this -d option.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>python -m http.server 8080 -d /tmp
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>It’s a great tool for quick downloads.</p>

