  <article>
    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2022/01/08/add-alias-in-csh.html">add alias in csh</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2022-01-08">08 January 2022</time></p>
    <p>How to add an alias in csh. Edit .cshrc file. Add an alias.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>alias hello ls -l
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Load.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>source .cshrc
</code></pre></div></div>

