  <article>
    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2021/08/04/sublime-text-terraform-syntax.html">sublime text terraform syntax</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2021-08-04">04 August 2021</time></p>
    <p>If you use Terraform and Sublime Text, add Terraform Syntax Highlighter using Package Control.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>Press Ctrl+Shift+P or Cmd+Shift+P.
Select “Package Control: Install package”
Select “Terraform”
</code></pre></div></div>

