     Upload:    11.81 Mbps (data used: 5.6 MB)                               
Packet Loss:     0.0%
 Result URL: https://www.speedtest.net/result/c/xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxxx (redacted)
</code></pre></div></div>

