  <article>
    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2021/04/16/sosreport.html">sosreport</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2021-04-16">16 April 2021</time></p>
    <p>Install</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>yum install sos
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Run sosreport</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>sosreport
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Case number will be part of exported report located in /var/tmp.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>cd /var/tmp
</code></pre></div></div>

