i-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx     server-two
i-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx     server-three
</code></pre></div></div>

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>[0].Value insures output is one instance record per line.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

