    <p>Snap is cool, but not for everyone. To remove, follow these steps.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code># get list
snap list
# remove snaps. repeat for each app.
snap remove chromium
# remove snapd
apt purge snapd
