    <p><time datetime="2020-06-16">16 June 2020</time></p>
    <p>Here’s the command to add a Linux user.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>useradd -m -s $(which bash) -G sudo ulysses
</code></pre></div></div>

