  <article>
    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2020/04/01/gitbash-bashrc.html">gitbash .bashrc</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2020-04-01">01 April 2020</time></p>
    <p>Here’s how to find your GitBash .bashrc.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code># cd takes you to gitbash home
cd 
