    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2020/01/24/tasksel-lampserver.html">tasksel lampserver</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2020-01-24">24 January 2020</time></p>
    <p><a href="http://wiki.debian.org/tasksel">Tasksel</a> is a Debian/Ubuntu tool that installs multiple related packages as a co-ordinated “task” onto your system. It’s similar to meta-packages where tasks are dericed from from Ubuntu package managers like Synaptic or KPackageKit.</p>

<p>Here’s a quickway to install a lamp server.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code># install tasksel first if you don't have it.
