    <p><time datetime="2020-01-20">20 January 2020</time></p>
    <p>Here’s my favorite Linux prompt.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>PS1='\[\033[01;32m\]\u@\h\[\033[00m\]:\[\033[01;34m\]\w\[\033[00m\]\$ '
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Add to end of your .bashrc to make it permanent.</p>

