<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>aws iam tag-user \
--user-name ulysses \
--tags "Key"="dept","Value"="it" "Key"="role","Value"="admin"
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Tags with identical keys are overwritten. New keys are added.</p>

