<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>gcloud compute instances describe server-name \
--zone us-central1-c \
--project project-id \
--format="flattened(serviceAccounts[].email)"
</code></pre></div></div>

