  <article>
    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2019/09/22/gcp-create-service-account.html">gcp create service account</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2019-09-22">22 September 2019</time></p>
    <p>Here’s how to create a GCP Service Account.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>gcloud beta iam service-accounts create service-account-name \
    --description "service account description" \
    --display-name "service account display name"
</code></pre></div></div>

