  <article>
    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2019/09/21/gcp-compute-disks-move.html">gcp compute disks move</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2019-09-21">21 September 2019</time></p>
    <p>Here’s how to move a GCP disk between zones.</p>

<ol>
  <li>Make sure disk is detached from instance.</li>
  <li>Use the GCloud Disk Move command.</li>
</ol>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code># Detach disk from instance
