  <article>
    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2019/08/30/copy-files-using-rsync.html">copy files using rsync</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2019-08-30">30 August 2019</time></p>
    <p>Here’s how to copy files from one directory to another.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>rsync -arvz /dir1 /dir2 &gt;&gt; /tmp/rsync.log &amp;
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Format: rsynch –options source destination</p>

<p>Options</p>

<ul>
  <li>-a archive mode</li>
  <li>-v verbose</li>
