    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2019/08/08/aws-cli-list-acm-certificates.html">aws cli list acm certificates</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2019-08-08">08 August 2019</time></p>
    <p>If you’ve imported or created a SSL certificate via AWS Certificate Manager, here’s the CLI to display a list of certificates.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>aws acm list-certificates
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Once you have the arn, you can describe certificate. Get the arn from the output above.</p>

