    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2019/07/26/aws-s3-upload-policy.html">aws s3 upload policy</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2019-07-26">26 July 2019</time></p>
    <p>Give someone upload access to a S3 bucket. Here’s the policy.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>{
   "Version":"2012-10-17",
   "Statement":[
      {
         "Effect":"Allow",
         "Action":[
            "s3:ListAllMyBuckets"
         ],
         "Resource":"arn:aws:s3:::*"
      },
      {
         "Effect":"Allow",
         "Action":[
            "s3:ListBucket",
            "s3:GetBucketLocation"
         ],
         "Resource":"arn:aws:s3:::your-bucket-name"
      },
      {
         "Effect":"Allow",
         "Action":[
            "s3:PutObject",
            "s3:PutObjectAcl",
            "s3:GetObject",
            "s3:GetObjectAcl",
            "s3:DeleteObject"
         ],
         "Resource":"arn:aws:s3:::your-bucket-name/*"
      }
   ]
}
</code></pre></div></div>

  </article>

