    <p>How to display AWS EC2 instance statuses.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>aws ec2 describe-instance-status \
--query 'InstanceStatuses[].[InstanceId,SystemStatus.Status]' \
--include-all-instances \
--region us-east-2
--profile abcdef \
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Query and Filter.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>aws ec2 describe-instance-status \
--query 'InstanceStatuses[].[InstanceId,SystemStatus.Status]' \
--filter 'Name=instance-state-name,Values=stopped' \
--region us-east-2
--profile abcdef \
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Filter event.code equal to instance-reboot.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>aws ec2 describe-instance-status \
--query 'InstanceStatuses[].[InstanceId,SystemStatus.Status]' \
--filter 'Name=eventcode,Values=instance-reboot' \
--region us-east-2
--profile abcdef \
</code></pre></div></div>

