<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>docker run -d \
-p 8000:8000 \
-e ICECAST_SOURCE_PASSWORD=aaaa \
-e ICECAST_ADMIN_PASSWORD=bbbb \
-e ICECAST_PASSWORD=cccc \
-e ICECAST_RELAY_PASSWORD=dddd \
moul/icecast
</code></pre></div></div>

