<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code># Redhat, Fedora, Centos, Amazon Linux
/var/www/html
# Debian, Ubuntu, Mint
/var/www/html
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Apache Configuration:</p>

