    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2019/07/04/matrox-monarch-configuration.html">matrox monarch configuration</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2019-07-04">04 July 2019</time></p>
    <p>You can import the Matrox Monarch HD configuration on boot up from a web page. Go to:</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>Command Center &gt; Automatic Configuration.
Type in URL Address starting with https.
Check "Load settings on device reboot."
You can either power off the device or hit reset.
Holding reset for more than 5 seconds does a factory reset.
On next bootup, device will have configuration contained from the remote file.
</code></pre></div></div>

