    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2019/07/04/convert-mp3-to-ogg.html">convert mp3 to ogg</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2019-07-04">04 July 2019</time></p>
    <p>Convert MP3 to Vorbis OGG format using ffmpeg.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>ffmpeg -i input.mp3 -c:a libvorbis -q:a 4 output.ogg
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>If you want multiple files, use a loop.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>for f in ./*.mp3; do ffmpeg -i "$f" -c:a libvorbis -q:a 4 "${f/%mp3/ogg}"; done
</code></pre></div></div>

