    <p><time datetime="2019-06-27">27 June 2019</time></p>
    <p>Here’s how to calculate epoch time using the Linux date command.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code># Linux
date --date @1561266781
date -d @1561266781
# MacOS
date -r 1561266781
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Output is : Sun Jun 23 05:13:01 UTC 2019</p>

<p>Show current epoch time.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>date +%s
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Output: 1561642643</p>

