  <article>
    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2019/06/10/removing-old-kernels.html">removing old kernels</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2019-06-10">10 June 2019</time></p>
    <p>How to check which kernel is running on your system</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>uname -sr
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>List all kernels installed on the system.</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>rpm -q kernel
</code></pre></div></div>

