  <article>
    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2019/04/30/xfs-vs-ext4-commands.html">xfs vs ext4 commands</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2019-04-30">30 April 2019</time></p>
    <p>File system command differences between ext3 and xfs.</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Task</th>
      <th>ext4</th>
      <th>xfs</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>Creating a file system</td>
      <td>mkfs.ext4</td>
      <td>mkfs.xfs</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Mounting a file system</td>
      <td>mount</td>
      <td>mount</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Resizing a file system</td>
      <td>resize2fs</td>
      <td>xfs_growfs</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Repairing a file system</td>
      <td>e2fsck</td>
      <td>xfs_repair</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Changing the label on a file system</td>
      <td>e2label</td>
      <td>xfs_admin -L</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Reporting on disk space and file usage</td>
      <td>quota</td>
      <td>quota</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Debugging a file system</td>
      <td>debugfs</td>
      <td>xfs_db</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Saving critical file system metadata to a file</td>
      <td>e2image</td>
      <td>xfs_metadump</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<div style="clear:both"></div>

  </article>

