    <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2019/02/24/aws-cli-efs-describe-tags.html">aws cli efs describe tags</a></h2>
    <p><time datetime="2019-02-24">24 February 2019</time></p>
    <p>How to display tags of EFS file system.</p>

